<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA SEPT TRADE DATA OUT FRIDAY AT 0800 GMT.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA SEPT TRADE DATA OUT FRIDAY AT 0800 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>September trade balance data would be released on Friday at 0800 GMT, the South African Revenue Services said on Thursday.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast a 720 million rand surplus compared with a 130 million rand surplus in August.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
